 <h3><u>Khaybar ka maajra suno</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span class=Apple-style-span arial,= sans-serif;= line-height:= normal;= border-collapse:= collapse;= color:= rgb(34,= 34,= 34);= =></span></p>
  <div>
   Shahibe Nade Ali (A.s.) , Gair Re Farrar Ali (A.s.).....3
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....2
   <br>
   <br>Khaibar Ki Karzar Ka Manzar Sunata Hun
   <br>Jibril Sath Do Mera Khaibar Sunata Hun
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Khaibar Ki Jung Abh Bhi Hai Duni Me Yadgar
   <br>ChAli (A.s.)s Din Taveel Hui Hai &nbsp;Yeh Karzar&nbsp;
   <br>Khud Sakhta Rasool Ke The Jitne Jaan Nisar
   <br>Maidan Chod Chod Ke Hote Rahe Farar
   <br>Lashkar Me Muslimon Ke Ajeeb Inteshar Tha
   <br>Har Ek Ke Dimag Me Marhab Sawar Tha
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Hasti Thi Maut Dekh Ke Har Roz Marka
   <br>Masroof Bhag Daud Me The Sare Surma
   <br>Woh Jung Thi Ke Jung Bhi Sharmai Zar Zar
   <br>Chalis Din Me Ek Bhi Zakhmi Nahi Hua
   <br>Marhab Jo Puchta Tha Ladonge Abhi Yanhin
   <br>Tege Chupa Ke Kehte The Sare Nahi Nahi
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Lashkar Ke Abtri Pe Yeh Kehne Lage Nabi
   <br>Ghabrao Mat Ladai Ke Yeh Shab Hai Aakhri
   <br>Ab Kal Jo Mard Hoga Alam Paienga Wahi
   <br>Dar Parda Tha Nabi Ke Labon Par Ali (A.s.) Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Yani Alam Alif Se Yeh Lashkar Uthaienga
   <br>Jo Gaib Se Alam Hai Woh Haidar Uthaienga
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Mazi Se Apna Peecha Chudate Hai Isliye
   <br>Apna Hadaf Alam Ko Banate Hai Kis Liye
   <br>Panje Ke Samt Ungli Uthate Hai Kisliye
   <br>Ab Samje Hum Alam Woh Jalate Hai Kis Liye
   <br>Unke Badon Ko Hakk Se Yeh Mansab Mila Nahi
   <br>Khaibar Ka Zakhm Hai Jo Abhi Tak Bhara Nahi
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Har Ke Ko Shak Tha Mera Hi Lenge Rasool Naam
   <br>Jaage Hue The Raat Ke Aankhen Thi Surkh Saam
   <br>Jo Chote Kad The Panjon Ke Bal The Khade Tamam
   <br>Itne Me Laaie Arash Se Jibrail Yeh Payam
   <br>Lashkar Na Kar Sakenga Tumhari Koi Madad
   <br>Allah (S.w.t.) Keh Raha Hai Kaho Ya Ali (A.s.) Madad
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Nade Ali (A.s.) Zaban E Mohammad (S.a.w.w)Pe Aa Gai
   <br>Aur Ustaraf Madine Me Kehne Lage Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Kambar Chalo Pukar Rahe Hai Humne Nabi
   <br>Dul Dul Ko Pyar Karke Yeh Farmaya Us Ghadi
   <br>Aaj Is Tarha Se Chal Ke Falak Kaap Ne Lage
   <br>Daude To Tere Sath Hawa Hanp Ne Lage
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Jaisa Kaha Tha Badshah E Khas O Aam Ne
   <br>Waisa Kiya Hai Dul Dul E Mehshar Khiyam Ne
   <br>Hairat Se Dekha Lashkar E Khairul Anam Ne
   <br>Sher E Khuda Khade The Mohammad (S.a.w.w.) Ke Saam Ne
   <br>Har Chehre Pe Sawal Tha Hazrat Kahan Se Aai
   <br>Salman Bole Aaj Ali (A.s.) Aasman Se Aaie
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Haq Se Alam Mila Sue Khaibar Ali (A.s.) Chale
   <br>Chumi Rakab Fatha Ne Aakar Ali (A.s.) Chale
   <br>Deen E Khuda Ka Banke Mukaddar Ali (A.s.) Chale
   <br>Lashkar Chala Zameen Pe Hawa Par Ali (A.s.) Chale
   <br>Aaya &nbsp; Hai &nbsp;Phir Jalal Imam E Mubeen Ko
   <br>Jibrail Jaldi Tham Lo Aakar Zameen Ko
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Hujjat Mariz E Maut Pe Hujjat Ne Ki Tamam
   <br>Ek Fikre Me Samet Diya Maqsad E Kalam
   <br>Haidar Hamari Maan Ne Rakha Hai Hamara Naam
   <br>Hushiyar Zulfikar Hui Meri Beniyam
   <br>Shamshir (a)buturab Ki San Se Pohuch Gai
   <br>Marhab Ke Sar Pe Maut Se Pehle Pohuch Gai
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Sar Se Chalis To Seene Pe Aakar Thahar Gai
   <br>Seene Pe Saans Leke Jigar Me Utar Gai
   <br>Nikli Jigar Ko Kaat Ke Taba Kamar Gai
   <br>Thi Muth Peeche Peeche Yeh Bijili Jidhar Gai
   <br>Katkar Adu E Deen E Khuda Khak Pe Gira
   <br>Aadha Idhar Zameen Pe Aadha Udhar Gira
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Jaata Hai Kis Shikoh Se Allah (S.w.t.)Ka Asad
   <br>Khaibar Ka Dar Ukhad Ne Tana Bashad Do Madh
   <br>Pohucha Kareeb E Dar Jo Woh Banda E Ahad
   <br>Besakhta Ali (A.s.) Ne Kaha Ya Ali (A.s.) Madad
   <br>Aaise Ukhada Lamhe Me Khaibar Ke Baab Ko
   <br>Jis Tarha Shakh Se Koi Tode Gulab Ko
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Takseem Sub Me Maal E Ganimat Kiya Gaya
   <br>Haidar Ko Hissa Sub Se Ziyada Diya Gaya
   <br>Is Amr Par Sawal Nabi Se Kiya Gaya
   <br>Kyun Adl Se Na Kaam Yahan Par Liya Gaya
   <br>Bole Rasool Dakhl Nahi Tujh Jaise Fard Ko
   <br>Dete Hai Hissa Dugna Shariat Me Mard Ko
   <br>
   <br>Suno Suno Suno Suno Khaibar Ka Majra Suno.....
   <br>
   <br>Allah (S.w.t.) Re Sakhawat E Mushkil Kusha Ali (A.s.)
   <br>Aaisa Kahan Hai Meer Takallum Koi Sakhi
   <br>Daulat Baname Male Ganimat Jo Thi Mili
   <br>Khairat Kardi Rahe Khuda Me Khushi Khushi
   <br>Dehliz E Dar Pe Pohuche To Salman To Sath The
   <br>Lab Par Khuda Ka Shukr Tha Aur KhAli Hath thea
